# The GitHub repo behind jamesbdm.github.io/bdm-pdf-tool is PUBLIC, and this
# folder holds plenty that shouldn't be — client PDFs, user guides, brand
# assets, backups, the agent skill. So the rule is deny-by-default: ignore
# everything, then name the files that are allowed out. Anything new you drop
# in this folder stays private unless it's added to the allow-list below.
*

# --- the live site ---
!.gitignore
!.gitattributes
!index.html
!BDM-PDF-Markup-Tool.html
!manifest.json

# --- icons (app, favicon, saved-document type icon) ---
!favicon.ico
!datum-pdf-document.ico
!icon-32.png
!icon-64.png
!icon-192.png
!icon-512.png
!icon-maskable-512.png
!doc-icon-16.png
!doc-icon-32.png
!doc-icon-48.png
!doc-icon-64.png
!doc-icon-192.png
!doc-icon-512.png

# --- docs that were already public in the repo ---
!BDM-PDF-MARKUP-TOOL-PROJECT-KNOWLEDGE.md
!DEPLOY-AS-APP.md
!GITHUB-DEPLOY-GUIDE.md

# Deliberately NOT published: BDM-PDF-Markup-Tool.BACKUP-*.html, *.docx,
# *.zip, *.skill, *.pdf, TEAM-INSTALL-GUIDE.md, app_current*.png,
# datum-markup/, ss/.
